## Overall Architecture

Next.js provides several advantages for this project:

- Server-side rendering (SSR) for improved performance
- API routes to handle backend functionality
- File-based routing for simpler navigation structure
- Built-in TypeScript support
- Easy integration with Cloudflare Workers

