## Key Modules and Views

### 1. Authentication Module

**Login Page** (`/login`)

- Login form with email/username and password
- "Remember me" option
- Password reset link
- Error handling for failed authentication

**Registration Page** (`/register`)

- For admin to create new user accounts
- Form with user details and role selection
- Validation for required fields

**Password Reset Page** (`/reset-password`)

- Email submission form
- Token verification
- New password entry form

### 2. Dashboard (`/dashboard`)

**Main Dashboard**

- Overview statistics for all modules
- Quick access cards to frequent tasks
- Recent activity feed
- Key performance metrics
- System notifications and alerts
- Quick search functionality

### 3. Employee Management (`/dashboard/employees`)

**Employee List View**

- Tabular view with sorting and filtering
- Search functionality
- Bulk actions (status change, department assignment)
- Quick view of key employee details

**Employee Detail View** (`/dashboard/employees/[id]`)

- Complete employee profile
- Employment history
- Skills and competencies
- Project assignments
- Performance metrics

**Employee Form View** (`/dashboard/employees/new` or `/dashboard/employees/[id]/edit`)

- Form for adding/editing employee information
- Personal details section
- Employment details section
- Skills and qualifications section
- Project assignments section

### 4. Finance Module (`/dashboard/finances`)

**Transactions Dashboard**

- Financial overview with charts
- Budget vs. actual comparisons
- Cash flow visualization
- Recent transactions list

**Transaction List View**

- Filterable table of all transactions
- Categorization options
- Export functionality
- Bulk operations

**Transaction Detail View** (`/dashboard/finances/transactions/[id]`)

- Complete transaction details
- Related documents
- Approval flow status
- Audit trail

**Budget Management View** (`/dashboard/finances/budgets`)

- Budget planning interface
- Allocation by department/project
- Budget vs. actual tracking
- Variance analysis

### 5. Product Management (`/dashboard/products`)

**Products List View**

- Table of all software products
- Version status indicators
- Search and filter functionality
- Quick actions menu

**Product Detail View** (`/dashboard/products/[id]`)

- Product specifications
- Version history
- Technical documentation links
- Dependencies visualization
- Development metrics

**Version Management View** (`/dashboard/products/[id]/versions`)

- Version lifecycle tracking
- Release notes management
- Deployment status
- QA test results

### 6. Project Management (`/dashboard/projects`)

**Projects Dashboard**

- Active projects overview
- Resource allocation visualization
- Project health indicators
- Timeline view of milestones

**Project List View**

- Filterable table of all projects
- Status indicators
- Progress visualization
- Team size and budget indicators

**Project Detail View** (`/dashboard/projects/[id]`)

- Project overview with timeline
- Team members and responsibilities
- Milestones and deliverables
- Budget status
