## Component Architecture

### Core Reusable Components

**DataTable Component**

- Used across all list views
- Features:
  - Pagination
  - Sorting
  - Filtering
  - Column customization
  - Selection for bulk actions
  - Export functionality

**Form Components**

- Input fields with validation
- Select components with search
- Date pickers
- File uploaders
- Rich text editors

**Chart Components**

- Line charts for time-series data
- Bar charts for comparisons
- Pie/Donut charts for distributions
- Gauge charts for KPIs
- Area charts for cumulative values

**Layout Components**

- Sidebar navigation
- Header with user menu
- Breadcrumb navigation
- Page layouts (single column, two column, etc.)

**Modal Components**

- Confirmation dialogs
- Form modals
- Information modals
- Alert modals

**Card Components**

- Stat cards for KPIs
- Info cards for dashboards
- Action cards for quick tasks

## UI/UX Considerations

**Consistent Design System**

- Color palette based on company branding
- Typography system with hierarchical scales
- Spacing system for consistent layout
- Component design consistency across modules

**Responsive Design**

- Mobile-friendly layouts
- Adapted views for tablets
- Full functionality on desktop
- Print-friendly views for reports

**Accessibility**

- ARIA labels for screen readers
- Keyboard navigation support
- Sufficient color contrast
- Focus state indicators

## API Integration

**Data Fetching Strategy**

- Server Components for initial data load
- React Query for client-side data fetching
- Optimistic updates for better UX
- Caching strategy for frequent data

**Authentication Flow**

- JWT stored in HTTP-only cookies
- Role-based page access control
- Token refresh mechanism
- Secure API routes
